(text "VALVE / E-STOP WIRING NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 30.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "acdbbffc-d4f6-4236-b261-48569839ef84"))
(text "Valve coils connect between pin 1 (+12V_VALVE) and pin 2 (switched return)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 34.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58b5185e-a9b9-4dcf-bec2-32ed6a93365b"))
(text "A bare DC solenoid coil is polarity free; if the valve has an LED or diode, wire + to pin 1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 38.400 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1c4da52e-31c9-4313-99cb-f1bb84849adc"))
(text "Each channel: 2.0 A design, 2.15 A worst case; MPT 0,5 rated 6 A, wire <= 0.5 mm2 (use ferrule/pigtail)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 42.800 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f52769a0-fa73-4514-a462-05e3d6d64535"))
(text "J7 is channel 7 (Teensy pin 30), used as a 12 V output." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 47.200 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e8d0064c-0305-4c8e-911d-c1434a9dbf6a"))
(text "" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 51.600 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "90fc5b7c-7f67-463c-b8f9-bbe9cbe9877e"))
(text "E-STOP: use a mushroom switch with two NC contact blocks." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 56.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d3a54317-f6c8-4b49-a1f1-14aa2332177c"))
(text "Contact A (J32 pins 1-2) hardware-cuts +12V_VALVE for all valves (Q10)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 60.400 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a29a3d48-ed21-4e1a-8f49-99144c76d3b1"))
(text "Contact B (J32 pins 3-4) drives Teensy pin 10: HIGH = OK, LOW = tripped." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 64.800 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e8ec053-b1e9-44d8-a14a-11d15cfd232e"))
(text "A single-contact switch works for the cut (pins 1-2); leave 3-4 open" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 69.200 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6995a3ba-2e05-4547-93a0-635aaddeb529"))
(text "(firmware then reads tripped: tie pins 3-4 only to a 2nd contact)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 73.600 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "26e2bdef-da40-4467-b9f1-13198f8b6f1b"))
(text "Open or disconnected wiring = valves OFF and input LOW (fail-safe)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 78.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c03d6b9a-21ed-44f7-9c71-fe7c4853081c"))
(text "If no E-stop is fitted yet, jumper J32 pins 1-2 or the valves stay unpowered." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 82.400 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ea7d3852-cc9a-49a0-a3f3-5301f0990474"))
(text "Silk at J32: CUT = pins 1-2, SENSE = pins 3-4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 86.800 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "320370d2-5c8a-46e9-85e2-0d9e349f94a6"))
(text "Power path through Q10 (AON6407): 14 A continuous capable;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 91.200 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9d0ad7e7-ed54-4eef-a7bf-61a89a88c73c"))
(text "the contact itself carries ~110 uA, so any E-stop block works." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.000 95.600 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "260c01cd-0613-46f9-a674-fff5b740f3d5"))
